   <dl class="kv">
    <dt>Meeting</dt><dd>Microbiome and Cancer Working Group Meeting (Meeting 2)</dd>
    <dt>Dates</dt><dd>Wednesday–Friday, November 18–20, 2026</dd>
    <dt>Venue</dt><dd>Swiss Re Centre for Global Dialogue<br>Gheistrasse 37, 8803 Rüschlikon, Switzerland</dd>
